summary: hung_task detector
description: |
    Test if hung_task detector is fine working.

    1. Dump stack trace completely
    2. Dump the registers
    3. Dump the code

    Try to check nmi stack via sysrq-trigger l option along side.
    That's because nmi stack can also hit issue.

    [Bug 1518139] hung_task: call trace missing in log.

contact: Chunyu Hu <chuhu@redhat.com>
test: make run
framework: beakerlib
id: 2585039b-b117-483b-93d0-68c0e6d19401
require:
    - gcc
    - glibc
    - elfutils-libelf-devel
    - perf
recommend:
    - rsyslog
    - stress-ng
duration: 1h
